sequenceDiagram
actor Approver as "Admin/authorized Operator"
participant UI as "Interface: UI"
participant API as "mainController: Controller"
participant Service as "inventoryLifecycleService: Service"
participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
Approver->>UI: Review write-off evidence and locked quantity
UI->>+API: Approve write-off command
API->>Service: approveWriteOff(id, version)
Service->>DB: Validate authority, evidence and eligible quantity
alt Valid approval
    Service->>DB: Reduce OnHand, mark disposed and append inventory transaction
    DB-->>API: Write-off approved
    API-->>-UI: Inventory updated
else Invalid quantity or stale version
    DB-->>API: Conflict; no stock change
    API-->>UI: Retry or resolve exception
end

